@startuml follow_bot_data_flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Luồng Dữ Liệu Hệ Thống Follow Bot

actor "Người được theo" as PERSON
database "Frame Buffer" as FRAME_BUF
database "LiDAR Buffer" as LIDAR_BUF
database "Identity Template" as IDENTITY

' ===== INPUT STAGE =====
PERSON --> CAM : Hình ảnh
CAM --> FRAME_BUF : Frame 1280x720

PERSON --> LIDAR : Phản xạ laser  
LIDAR --> LIDAR_BUF : Raw packets

' ===== PROCESSING STAGE =====
FRAME_BUF --> YOLO_PERSON : BGR → RGB
FRAME_BUF --> YOLO_FACE : BGR → RGB

YOLO_PERSON --> DETECT_PROC : Person bboxes
YOLO_FACE --> DETECT_PROC : Face bboxes

DETECT_PROC --> IDENTITY : Appearance histograms
IDENTITY --> DETECT_PROC : Similarity scores

DETECT_PROC --> NAV_DECISION : Navigation box
NAV_DECISION --> X_NORM : Pixel → normalized

X_NORM --> EMA_FILTER : Raw x_norm
EMA_FILTER --> TURN_CMD : Smoothed x_norm

LIDAR_BUF --> LIDAR_PROC : Raw data
LIDAR_PROC --> DISTANCE_MAP : 360° distances
DISTANCE_MAP --> FRONT_DIST : Median filter
DISTANCE_MAP --> SECTOR_FLAGS : Obstacle detection

FRONT_DIST --> SPEED_CMD : Distance error
SECTOR_FLAGS --> AVOID_CMD : Override logic

' ===== COMMAND FUSION =====
TURN_CMD --> CMD_FILTER : w_raw
SPEED_CMD --> CMD_FILTER : v_raw
AVOID_CMD --> CMD_FILTER : override

CMD_FILTER --> DEADZONE : Remove small commands
DEADZONE --> SLEW_LIMIT : Limit rate change
SLEW_LIMIT --> DIFF_DRIVE : v_cmd, w_cmd

DIFF_DRIVE --> MOTOR_CMD : left/right speeds
MOTOR_CMD --> ROBOT : PWM signals

ROBOT --> PERSON : Physical following

' ===== FEEDBACK LOOPS =====
X_NORM -.-> EMA_FILTER : Previous value
FRONT_DIST -.-> EMA_FILTER : Previous distance
SLEW_LIMIT -.-> SLEW_LIMIT : Previous commands

' ===== DATA ANNOTATIONS =====
note right of YOLO_PERSON
  Input: BGR frame
  Output: [(x1,y1,x2,y2), conf]
  Filter: conf ≥ 0.5, class=0
end note

note right of IDENTITY
  shirt_hist: H-channel 16 bins
  pants_hist: H+S channels 32 bins
  Frozen after first lock
end note

note bottom of CMD_FILTER
  Deadzone: |cmd| < threshold → 0
  Slew: |Δcmd| < max_step
  Safety: Always applicable
end note

' ===== TIMING =====
note top of FRAME_BUF : 30fps
note top of LIDAR_BUF : ~10Hz full rotations
note bottom of ROBOT : 20Hz control loop

@enduml